 "end": 90348, "text": "And he made his camels to kneel down without the city by a well of water at the time of the evening, even the time that women go out to draw water.", "words": [[0, 81924], [4, 82048], [7, 82148], [12, 82368], [16, 82528], [23, 83068], [26, 83228], [32, 83548], [37, 83788], [45, 84088], [49, 84368], [54, 84648], [57, 84948], [59, 85068], [64, 85288], [67, 85508], [73, 85848], [76, 86108], [80, 86208], [85, 86488], [88, 86668], [92, 86768], [101, 87590], [106, 87950], [110, 88130], [115, 88390], [120, 88590], [126, 88850], [129, 89130], [133, 89370], [136, 89550], [141, 89810]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 90798, "end": 98189, "text": "And he said, O LORD God of my master Abraham, please, send me good speed this day, and show kindness to my master Abraham.", "words": [[0, 90798], [4, 90933], [7, 91073], [13, 92532], [15, 92698], [20, 92898], [24, 93118], [27, 93278], [30, 93418], [37, 93718], [46, 94278], [54, 94478], [59, 95138], [62, 95298], [67, 95458], [73, 95678], [78, 95918], [83, 96138], [87, 96538], [92, 96718], [101, 96998], [104, 97238], [107, 97358], [114, 97658]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 98639, "end": 103438, "text": "Behold, I stand here by the well of water; and the daughters of the men of the city come out to draw water:", "words": [[0, 98639], [8, 98980], [10, 99040], [16, 99280], [21, 99520], [24, 99680], [28, 99820], [33, 99960], [36, 100080], [43, 100735], [47, 100841], [51, 100941], [61, 101201], [64, 101421], [68, 101541], [72, 101721], [75, 101841], [79, 101941], [84, 102161], [89, 102421], [93, 102561], [96, 102741], [101, 102981]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 103888, "end": 120212, "text": "And let it come to pass, that the young woman to whom I shall say, Let down your pitcher, please, that I may drink; and she shall say, Drink, and I will give your camels drink also: let the same be she that you have appointed for your servant Isaac; and by it shall I know that you have showed kindness to my master.", "words": [[0, 103888], [4, 103985], [8, 104125], [11, 104205], [16, 104385], [19, 104525], [25, 104885], [30, 105225], [34, 105405], [40, 105585], [46, 105825], [49, 105985], [54, 106165], [56, 106285], [62, 106465], [67, 107045], [71, 107265], [76, 107505], [81, 107645], [90, 108005], [98, 108705], [103, 108805], [105, 108925], [109, 109005], [116, 109773], [120, 109877], [124, 109997], [130, 110197], [135, 110912], [142, 111072], [146, 111292], [148, 111512], [153, 111712], [158, 111932], [163, 112112], [170, 112572], [176, 112772], [182, 113807], [186, 113987], [190, 114147], [195, 114387], [198, 114607], [202, 114847], [207, 115087], [211, 115227], [216, 115347], [226, 115687], [230, 115927], [235, 116047], [243, 116327], [250, 117300], [254, 117438], [257, 117658], [260, 117818], [266, 117938], [268, 118098], [273, 118318], [278, 118498], [282, 118638], [287, 118758], [294, 118958], [303, 119378], [306, 119638], [309, 119738]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 120562, "end": 133823, "text": "¶ And it came to pass, before he had done speaking, that, behold, Rebekah came out, who was born to Bethuel, son of Milcah, the wife of Nahor, Abraham’s brother, with her pitcher upon her shoulder.", "words": [[2, 120562], [6, 120691], [9, 120791], [14, 121031], [17, 121231], [23, 121991], [30, 122311], [33, 122611], [37, 122751], [42, 122951], [52, 123871], [58, 124191], [66, 124751], [74, 125311], [79, 125711], [84, 126391], [88, 126471], [92, 126651], [97, 126951], [100, 127151], [109, 127931], [113, 128131], [116, 128631], [124, 129131], [128, 129251], [133, 129471], [136, 129651], [143, 130491], [153, 131211], [162, 132020], [167, 132165], [171, 132385], [179, 132605], [184, 132965], [188, 133185]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 134273, "end": 142813, "text": "And the young woman was very fair to look upon, a virgin, neither had any man known her: and she went down to the well, and filled her pitcher, and came up.", "words": [[0, 134273], [4, 134400], [8, 134500], [14, 134700], [20, 134960], [24, 135180], [29, 135460], [34, 135720], [37, 135880], [42, 136020], [48, 136840], [50, 136940], [58, 137340], [66, 137820], [70, 138100], [74, 138360], [78, 138640], [84, 138920], [89, 139658], [93, 139786], [97, 139926], [102, 140106], [107, 140346], [110, 140506], [114, 140606], [120, 140826], [124, 141146], [131, 141346], [135, 141576], [144, 141806], [148, 142186], [153, 142406]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 143263, "end": 148269, "text": "And the servant ran to meet her, and said, Let me, please, drink a little water of your pitcher.", "words": [[0, 143263], [4, 143408], [8, 143508], [16, 143808], [20, 144128], [23, 144328], [28, 144568], [33, 144748], [37, 144968], [43, 145677], [47, 145848], [51, 145988], [59, 146288], [65, 146908], [67, 147108], [74, 147208], [80, 147508], [83, 147688], [88, 147788]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 148619, "end": 156636, "text": "And she said, Drink, my lord: and she hasted, and let down her pitcher upon her hand, and gave him drink.", "words": [[0, 148619], [4, 148723], [8, 148883], [14, 150463], [21, 150887], [24, 150987], [30, 151889], [34, 152016], [38, 152156], [46, 152776], [50, 153256], [54, 153476], [59, 153796], [63, 153976], [71, 154296], [76, 154616], [80, 154876], [86, 155276], [90, 155736], [95, 155956], [99, 156136]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 157086, "end": 163633, "text": "And when she had done giving him drink, she said, I will draw water for your camels also, until they have done drinking.", "words": [[0, 157086], [4, 157227], [9, 157387], [13, 157587], [17, 157767], [22, 157987], [29, 158267], [33, 158507], [40, 159107], [44, 159247], [50, 160013], [52, 160133], [57, 160233], [62, 160413], [68, 160733], [72, 160953], [77, 161093], [84, 161493], [90, 162253], [96, 162513], [101, 162733], [106, 162813], [111, 162973]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 163983, "end": 170976, "text": "And she hasted, and emptied her pitcher into the trough, and ran again to the well to draw water, and drew for all his camels.", "words": [[0, 163983], [4, 164101], [8, 164261], [16, 164841], [20, 165001], [28, 165381], [32, 165501], [40, 165801], [45, 166081], [49, 166241], [57, 166701], [61, 167101], [65, 167321], [71, 167621], [74, 167821], [78, 167941], [83, 168201], [86, 168401], [91, 168681], [98, 169061], [102, 169581], [107, 169781], [111, 169981], [115, 170161], [119, 170321]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 171426, "end": 178006, "text": "And the man wondering at her kept silent, that is whether the LORD had made his journey prosperous or not.", "words": [[0, 171426], [4, 171574], [8, 171654], [12, 171914], [22, 172394], [25, 172674], [29, 172854], [34, 173114], [42, 174154], [47, 174414], [50, 174774], [58, 174974], [62, 175194], [67, 175474], [71, 175714], [76, 175934], [80, 176194], [88, 176534], [99, 177034], [102, 177534]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 178456, "end": 188508, "text": "And it came to pass, as the camels had done drinking, that the man took a golden earring of half a shekel weight, and two bracelets for her hands of ten shekels weight of gold;", "words": [[0, 178456], [4, 178592], [7, 178692], [12, 178872], [15, 179052], [21, 179632], [24, 179792], [28, 179932], [35, 180352], [39, 180492], [44, 180672], [54, 181472], [59, 181692], [63, 181832], [67, 182032], [72, 182252], [74, 182412], [81, 182712], [89, 183232], [92, 183372], [97, 183632], [99, 183752], [106, 184132], [114, 184935], [118, 185087], [122, 185287], [132, 185767], [136, 186087], [140, 186267], [146, 186587], [149, 186807], [153, 187027], [161, 187607], [168, 187807], [171, 187967]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 188958, "end": 194535, "text": "And said, Whose daughter are you? tell me, please: is there room in your father’s house for us to lodge in?", "words": [[0, 188958], [4, 189123], [10, 189891], [16, 190020], [25, 190300], [29, 190480], [34, 191128], [39, 191244], [43, 191384], [51, 192184], [54, 192282], [60, 192442], [65, 192682], [68, 192802], [73, 192922], [82, 193302], [88, 193462], [92, 193702], [95, 193842], [98, 193962], [104, 194242]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 194885, "end": 200839, "text": "And she said to him, I am the daughter of Bethuel the son of Milcah, which she bore to Nahor.", "words": [[0, 194885], [4, 195028], [8, 195188], [13, 195428], [16, 195628], [21, 196251], [23, 196471], [26, 196731], [30, 196871], [39, 197151], [42, 197431], [50, 198191], [54, 198291], [58, 198531], [61, 198951], [69, 199371], [75, 199511], [79, 199751], [84, 200011], [87, 200251]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 201189, "end": 207217, "text": "She said moreover to him, We have both straw and provender enough, and room to lodge in.", "words": [[0, 201189], [4, 201354], [9, 201734], [18, 202114], [21, 202334], [26, 202960], [29, 203066], [34, 203226], [39, 203466], [45, 204026], [49, 204536], [59, 205046], [67, 205786], [71, 206026], [76, 206286], [79, 206486], [85, 206806]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 207567, "end": 210985, "text": "And the man bowed down his head, and worshipped the LORD.", "words": [[0, 207567], [4, 207697], [8, 207817], [12, 208097], [18, 208617], [23, 208817], [27, 209077], [33, 209437], [37, 209917], [48, 210397], [52, 210457]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 211435, "end": 222844, "text": "And he said, Blessed be the LORD God of my master Abraham, who has not left destitute my master of his mercy and his truth: I being in the way, the LORD led me to the house of my master’s brethren.", "words": [[0, 211435], [4, 211560], [7, 211680], [13, 212418], [21, 212675], [24, 212975], [28, 213135], [33, 213355], [37, 213615], [40, 213775], [43, 213915], [50, 214255], [59, 215015], [63, 215255], [67, 215395], [71, 215575], [76, 215855], [86, 216435], [89, 216635], [96, 217015], [99, 217195], [103, 217335], [109, 217695], [113, 218055], [117, 218235], [124, 218965], [126, 219219], [132, 219459], [135, 219639], [139, 219739], [144, 220339], [148, 220439], [153, 220639], [157, 220879], [160, 221079], [163, 221239], [167, 221379], [173, 221639], [176, 221819], [179, 221959], [188, 222399]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 223194, "end": 227159, "text": "And the young woman ran, and told them of her mother’s house these things.", "words": [[0, 223194], [4, 223325], [8, 223445], [14, 223665], [20, 223945], [25, 224425], [29, 224745], [34, 225025], [39, 225285], [42, 225445], [46, 225545], [55, 226005], [61, 226205], [67, 226485]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 227609, "end": 233488, "text": "¶ And Rebekah had a brother, and his name was Laban: and Laban ran out to the man, to the well.", "words": [[2, 227609], [6, 227816], [14, 228056], [18, 228456], [20, 228556], [29, 228816], [33, 229196], [37, 229376], [42, 229716], [46, 229956], [53, 230916], [57, 231079], [63, 231539], [67, 231859], [71, 232099], [74, 232299], [78, 232419], [83, 232699], [86, 232959], [90, 233059]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 233938, "end": 248793, "text": "And it came to pass, when he saw the earring and bracelets upon his sister’s hands, and when he heard the words of Rebekah his sister, saying, Thus spoke the man to me; that he came to the man; and, behold, he stood by the camels at the well.", "words": [[0, 233938], [4, 234061], [7, 234161], [12, 234421], [15, 234601], [21, 235441], [26, 235741], [29, 235881], [33, 236101], [37, 236261], [45, 236721], [49, 236841], [59, 237281], [64, 237621], [68, 237881], [77, 238321], [84, 239101], [88, 239221], [93, 239361], [96, 239521], [102, 239701], [106, 239861], [112, 240141], [115, 240581], [123, 241021], [127, 241061], [135, 241441], [143, 242357], [148, 242498], [154, 242778], [158, 242958], [162, 243178], [165, 243378], [169, 244034], [174, 244197], [177, 244297], [182, 244597], [185, 244777], [189, 244877], [194, 245717], [199, 245880], [207, 246740], [210, 246920], [216, 247200], [219, 247440], [223, 247600], [230, 248060], [233, 248200], [237, 248300]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 249093, "end": 256738, "text": "And he said, Come in, you blessed of the LORD; why do you stand without? for I have prepared the house, and room for the camels.", "words": [[0, 249093], [4, 249213], [7, 249373], [13, 249613], [18, 249873], [22, 250433], [26, 250533], [34, 250793], [37, 251053], [41, 251193], [47, 251927], [51, 252152], [54, 252352], [58, 252492], [64, 252752], [73, 253702], [77, 253826], [79, 254066], [84, 254246], [93, 254686], [97, 254926], [104, 255226], [108, 255566], [113, 255806], [117, 256046], [121, 256166]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 257088, "end": 267616, "text": "¶ And the man came into the house: and he ungirded his camels, and gave straw and provender for the camels, and water to wash his feet, and the men’s feet that were with him.", "words": [[2, 257088], [6, 257241], [10, 257341], [14, 257601], [19, 257881], [24, 258161], [28, 258321], [35, 259283], [39, 259445], [42, 259605], [51, 260345], [55, 260505], [63, 261265], [67, 261525], [72, 261725], [78, 262145], [82, 262535], [92, 262925], [96, 263065], [100, 263185], [108, 263685], [112, 263825], [118, 264185], [121, 264425], [126, 264705], [130, 264925], [136, 265785], [140, 265965], [144, 266085], [150, 266445], [155, 266685], [160, 266885], [165, 267045], [170, 267325]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 268066, "end": 276660, "text": "And there was set food before him to eat: but he said, I will not eat, until I have told my errand. And he said, Speak on.", "words": [[0, 268066], [4, 268210], [10, 268350], [14, 268510], [18, 268770], [23, 269070], [30, 269410], [34, 269630], [37, 269790], [42, 270488], [46, 270612], [49, 270752], [55, 271609], [57, 271709], [62, 271869], [66, 272049], [71, 272309], [77, 272769], [79, 272949], [84, 273069], [89, 273309], [92, 273709], [100, 274403], [104, 274537], [107, 274677], [113, 276136], [119, 276315]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 277010, "end": 280189, "text": "And he said, I am Abraham’s servant.", "words": [[0, 277010], [4, 277145], [7, 277285], [13, 278743], [15, 278883], [18, 279003], [28, 279743]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 280639, "end": 291359, "text": "And the LORD has blessed my master greatly; and he is become great: and he has given him flocks, and herds, and silver, and gold, and menservants, and maidservants, and camels, and donkeys.", "words": [[0, 280639], [4, 280766], [8, 280886], [13, 281086], [17, 281306], [25, 281606], [28, 281846], [35, 282206], [44, 283114], [48, 283275], [51, 283425], [54, 283575], [61, 283895], [68, 284645], [72, 284763], [75, 284923], [79, 285063], [85, 285303], [89, 285523], [97, 286443], [101, 286463], [108, 287083], [112, 287143], [120, 287963], [124, 287983], [130, 288563], [134, 288903], [147, 289243], [151, 289303], [165, 290063], [169, 290103], [177, 290763], [181, 290763]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 291809, "end": 298057, "text": "And Sarah my master’s wife bore a son to my master when she was old: and to him has he given all that he has.", "words": [[0, 291809], [4, 291911], [10, 292351], [13, 292411], [22, 292931], [27, 293271], [32, 293411], [34, 293551], [38, 293731], [41, 293871], [44, 294011], [51, 294331], [56, 294531], [60, 294691], [64, 294911], [69, 295648], [73, 295767], [76, 295907], [80, 296207], [84, 296547], [87, 296667], [93, 296867], [97, 297227], [102, 297467], [105, 297587]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 298507, "end": 305435, "text": "And my master made me swear, saying, You shall not take a wife to my son of the daughters of the Canaanites, in whose land I dwell:", "words": [[0, 298507], [4, 298624], [7, 298784], [14, 299164], [19, 299464], [22, 299584], [29, 300184], [37, 300624], [41, 300744], [47, 300964], [51, 301204], [56, 301464], [58, 301604], [63, 301824], [66, 302004], [69, 302144], [73, 302404], [76, 302484], [80, 302624], [90, 302884], [93, 303064], [97, 303184], [109, 304164], [112, 304284], [118, 304444], [123, 304784], [125, 304944]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 305885, "end": 310730, "text": "But you shall go to my father’s house, and to my kindred, and take a wife to my son.", "words": [[0, 305885], [4, 306040], [8, 306180], [14, 306340], [17, 306520], [20, 306660], [23, 306800], [32, 307320], [39, 307560], [43, 308100], [46, 308260], [49, 308380], [58, 308900], [62, 309380], [67, 309600], [69, 309740], [74, 309960], [77, 310140], [80, 310280]]}, {"verse": 39, "start": 311180, "end": 314549, "text": "And I said to my master, Perhaps the woman will not follow me.", "words": [[0, 311180], [4, 311322], [6, 311422], [11, 311642], [14, 311782], [17, 311922], [25, 312542], [33, 312962], [37, 313262], [43, 313502], [48, 313742], [52, 313942], [59, 314222]]}, {"verse": 40, "start": 314999, "end": 324384, "text": "And he said to me, The LORD, before whom I walk, will send his angel with you, and prosper your way; and you shall take a wife for my son of my kindred, and of my father’s house:", "words": [[0, 314999], [4, 315124], [7, 315244], [12, 315464], [15, 315604], [19, 315724], [23, 315864], [29, 316144], [36, 316664], [41, 316944], [43, 317124], [49, 317424], [54, 317704], [59, 317944], [63, 318104], [69, 318464], [74, 318724], [79, 318924], [83, 319264], [91, 319664], [96, 319944], [101, 320675], [105, 320783], [109, 320883], [115, 321023], [120, 321243], [122, 321383], [127, 321633], [131, 321883], [134, 322023], [138, 322243], [141, 322343], [144, 322483], [153, 322923], [157, 323263], [160, 323383], [163, 323503], [172, 323923]]}, {"verse": 41, "start": 324834, "end": 331316, "text": "Then shall you be clear from this my oath, when you come to my kindred; and if they give not you one, you shall be clear from my oath.", "words": [[0, 324834], [5, 324972], [11, 325172], [15, 325312], [18, 325452], [24, 325772], [29, 325992], [34, 326152], [37, 326332], [43, 326612], [48, 326872], [52, 326972], [57, 327152], [60, 327292], [63, 327432], [72, 328283], [76, 328381], [79, 328481], [84, 328601], [89, 328821], [93, 329021], [97, 329301], [102, 329761], [106, 329961], [112, 330141], [115, 330301], [121, 330601], [126, 330821], [129, 331061]]}, {"verse": 42, "start": 331766, "end": 338758, "text": "And I came this day to the well, and said, O LORD God of my master Abraham, if now you do prosper my way which I go:", "words": [[0, 331766], [4, 331917], [6, 332017], [11, 332237], [16, 332457], [20, 332677], [23, 332817], [27, 332897], [33, 333137], [37, 333377], [43, 333997], [45, 334157], [50, 334457], [54, 334777], [57, 334937], [60, 335117], [67, 335457], [76, 336417], [79, 336537], [83, 336737], [87, 336937], [90, 337077], [98, 337457], [101, 337757], [105, 338017], [111, 338237], [113, 338377]]}, {"verse": 43, "start": 339208, "end": 349772, "text": "Behold, I stand by the well of water; and it shall come to pass, that when the virgin comes forth to draw water, and I say to her, Give me, please, a little water of your pitcher to drink;", "words": [[0, 339208], [8, 339764], [10, 339904], [16, 340244], [19, 340564], [23, 340704], [28, 340844], [31, 341024], [38, 341717], [42, 341821], [45, 341921], [51, 342061], [56, 342301], [59, 342441], [65, 342761], [70, 343181], [75, 343381], [79, 343541], [86, 343841], [92, 344141], [98, 344501], [101, 344761], [106, 345021], [113, 345601], [117, 345761], [119, 345881], [123, 346061], [126, 346181], [131, 346581], [136, 346781], [140, 347201], [148, 347916], [150, 348022], [157, 348202], [163, 348562], [166, 348802], [171, 348922], [179, 349162], [182, 349382]]}, {"verse": 44, "start": 350222, "end": 358242, "text": "And she say to me, Both drink you, and I will also draw for your camels: let the same be the woman whom the LORD has appointed out for my master’s son.", "words": [[0, 350222], [4, 350319], [8, 350499], [12, 350679], [15, 350819], [19, 351199], [24, 351419], [30, 351779], [35, 352039], [39, 352379], [41, 352499], [46, 352639], [51, 352939], [56, 353219], [60, 353399], [65, 353539], [73, 354432], [77, 354599], [81, 354799], [86, 355059], [89, 355259], [93, 355399], [99, 355599], [104, 355819], [108, 355999], [113, 356199], [117, 356399], [127, 356759], [131, 357039], [135, 357219], [138, 357379], [147, 357939]]}, {"verse": 45, "start": 358692, "end": 369046, "text": "And before I had done speaking in my heart, behold, Rebekah came forth with her pitcher on her shoulder; and she went down to the well, and drew water: and I said to her, Let me drink, please.", "words": [[0, 358692], [4, 358836], [11, 359136], [13, 359336], [17, 359476], [22, 359676], [31, 359996], [34, 360256], [37, 360396], [44, 360996], [52, 361506], [60, 362016], [65, 362416], [71, 362696], [76, 362916], [80, 363106], [88, 363296], [91, 363576], [95, 363696], [105, 364465], [109, 364581], [113, 364701], [118, 364861], [123, 365101], [126, 365281], [130, 365381], [136, 365641], [140, 366061], [145, 366241], [152, 367004], [156, 367122], [158, 367262], [163, 367462], [166, 367622], [171, 368002], [175, 368122], [178, 368282], [185, 368642]]}, {"verse": 46, "start": 369496, "end": 377946, "text": "And she made haste, and let down her pitcher from her shoulder, and said, Drink, and I will give your camels drink also: so I drank, and she made the camels drink also.", "words": [[0, 369496], [4, 369622], [8, 369762], [13, 369962], [20, 370442], [24, 370542], [28, 370682], [33, 370922], [37, 371102], [45, 371402], [50, 371662], [54, 371782], [64, 372062], [68, 372282], [74, 372442], [81, 372782], [85, 373262], [87, 373382], [92, 373502], [97, 373749], [102, 373995], [109, 374242], [115, 374442], [121, 375335], [124, 375452], [126, 375532], [133, 375832], [137, 376212], [141, 376392], [146, 376572], [150, 376712], [157, 377112], [163, 377312]]}, {"verse": 47, "start": 378396, "end": 391199, "text": "And I asked her, and said, Whose daughter are you? And she said, The daughter of Bethuel, Nahor’s son, whom Milcah bore to him: and I put the earring upon her face, and the bracelets upon her hands.", "words": [[0, 378396], [4, 378537], [6, 378657], [12, 378937], [17, 379137], [21, 379337], [27, 379737], [33, 379917], [42, 380317], [46, 380557], [51, 381207], [55, 381311], [59, 381471], [65, 383051], [69, 383134], [78, 383434], [81, 383694], [90, 384214], [98, 384914], [103, 385514], [108, 385824], [115, 386134], [120, 386394], [123, 386594], [128, 387306], [132, 387446], [134, 387546], [138, 387726], [142, 387906], [150, 388326], [155, 388506], [159, 388706], [165, 389006], [169, 389506], [173, 389626], [183, 390046], [188, 390386], [192, 390626]]}, {"verse": 48, "start": 391649, "end": 401011, "text": "And I bowed down my head, and worshipped the LORD, and blessed the LORD God of my master Abraham, which had led me in the right way to take my master’s brother’s daughter to his son.", "words": [[0, 391649], [4, 391786], [6, 391956], [12, 392126], [17, 392386], [20, 392586], [26, 392866], [30, 393206], [41, 393546], [45, 393786], [51, 394066], [55, 394396], [63, 394726], [67, 395006], [72, 395346], [76, 395506], [79, 395666], [82, 395826], [89, 396326], [98, 397201], [104, 397341], [108, 397501], [112, 397701], [115, 397901], [118, 398021], [122, 398101], [128, 398361], [132, 398581], [135, 398741], [140, 398941], [143, 399101], [152, 399661], [162, 400041], [171, 400301], [174, 400521], [178, 400641]]}, {"verse": 49, "start": 401461, "end": 409483, "text": "And now if you will deal kindly and truly with my master, tell me: and if not, tell me; that I may turn to the right hand, or to the left.", "words": [[0, 401461], [4, 401563], [8, 401783], [11, 401943], [15, 402043], [20, 402163], [25, 402363], [32, 402803], [36, 403023], [42, 403263], [47, 403523], [50, 403683], [58, 404343], [63, 404563], [67, 405098], [71, 405378], [74, 405678], [79, 405878], [84, 406178], [88, 406766], [93, 406906], [95, 407046], [99, 407186], [104, 407486], [107, 407646], [111, 407786], [117, 407946], [123, 408306], [126, 408726], [129, 408906], [133, 409026]]}, {"verse": 50, "start": 409833, "end": 417207, "text": "Then Laban and Bethuel answered and said, The thing proceeds from the LORD: we cannot speak to you bad or good.", "words": [[0, 409833], [5, 410098], [11, 410658], [15, 410898], [23, 411358], [32, 411798], [36, 412078], [42, 412818], [46, 412998], [52, 413258], [61, 413758], [66, 414038], [70, 414198], [76, 415021], [79, 415128], [86, 415408], [92, 415728], [95, 415948], [99, 416088], [103, 416408], [106, 416648]]}, {"verse": 51, "start": 417657, "end": 426405, "text": "Behold, Rebekah is before you, take her, and go, and let her be your master’s son’s wife, as the LORD has spoken.", "words": [[0, 417657], [8, 418035], [16, 418445], [19, 418825], [26, 419225], [31, 419845], [36, 420045], [41, 420745], [45, 420825], [49, 421605], [53, 421745], [57, 421885], [61, 422065], [64, 422265], [69, 422445], [78, 423025], [84, 423345], [90, 423805], [93, 423965], [97, 424125], [102, 424345], [106, 424525]]}, {"verse": 52, "start": 426855, "end": 434258, "text": "And it came to pass, that, when Abraham’s servant heard their words, he worshipped the LORD, bowing himself to the earth.", "words": [[0, 426855], [4, 426981], [7, 427121], [12, 427321], [15, 427521], [21, 428281], [27, 428601], [32, 429001], [42, 429681], [50, 429901], [56, 430221], [62, 430441], [69, 431301], [72, 431631], [83, 431961], [87, 432041], [93, 432741], [100, 433081], [108, 433441], [111, 433721], [115, 433881]]}, {"verse": 53, "start": 434708, "end": 445260, "text": "And the servant brought forth jewels of silver, and jewels of gold, and clothing, and gave them to Rebekah: he gave also to her brother and to her mother precious things.", "words": [[0, 434708], [4, 434852], [8, 434952], [16, 435312], [24, 435652], [30, 436012], [37, 436372], [40, 436672], [48, 437112], [52, 437672], [59, 437972], [62, 438252], [68, 438652], [72, 438912], [82, 439312], [86, 439792], [91, 439992], [96, 440212], [99, 440352], [108, 441321], [111, 441426], [116, 441606], [121, 441966], [124, 442206], [128, 442366], [136, 442646], [140, 443106], [143, 443226], [147, 443386], [154, 443646], [163, 444086]]}, {"verse": 54, "start": 445710, "end": 454519, "text": "And they did eat and drink, he and the men that were with him, and stayed all night; and they rose up in the morning, and he said, Send me away to my master.", "words": [[0, 445710], [4, 445855], [9, 445975], [13, 446175], [17, 446435], [21, 446595], [28, 447255], [31, 447575], [35, 447715], [39, 447835], [43, 447995], [48, 448135], [53, 448255], [58, 448515], [63, 448695], [67, 449015], [74, 449295], [78, 449535], [85, 450277], [89, 450384], [94, 450504], [99, 450724], [102, 450944], [105, 451044], [109, 451144], [118, 451444], [122, 451664], [125, 451784], [131, 452442], [136, 452599], [139, 452799], [144, 453079], [147, 453219], [150, 453379]]}, {"verse": 55, "start": 454869, "end": 462622, "text": "And her brother and her mother said, Let the young woman abide with us a few days, at the least ten; after that she shall go.", "words": [[0, 454869], [4, 455035], [8, 455115], [16, 455415], [20, 455695], [24, 455835], [31, 456075], [37, 456795], [41, 457035], [45, 457255], [51, 457495], [57, 457855], [63, 458255], [68, 458595], [71, 458815], [73, 458975], [77, 459175], [83, 459495], [86, 459875], [90, 460015], [96, 460430], [101, 461067], [107, 461351], [112, 461791], [116, 461911], [122, 462151]]}, {"verse": 56, "start": 463072, "end": 469628, "text": "And he said to them, Hinder me not, seeing the LORD has prospered my way; send me away that I may go to my master.", "words": [[0, 463072], [4, 463486], [7, 463606], [12, 463826], [15, 464026], [21, 464681], [28, 464959], [31, 465119], [36, 465319], [43, 465619], [47, 465799], [52, 466039], [56, 466199], [66, 466779], [69, 466879], [74, 467468], [79, 467693], [82, 467923], [87, 468153], [92, 468333], [94, 468433], [98, 468613], [101, 468833], [104, 468973], [107, 469133]]}, {"verse": 57, "start": 469978, "end": 473592, "text": "And they said, We will call the young woman, and enquire at her mouth.", "words": [[0, 469978], [4, 470125], [9, 470245], [15, 470485], [18, 470625], [23, 470765], [28, 471005], [32, 471185], [38, 471405], [45, 471745], [49, 472285], [57, 472825], [60, 472925], [64, 473045]]}, {"verse": 58, "start": 474042, "end": 479840, "text": "And they called Rebekah, and said to her, Will you go with this man? And she said, I will go.", "words": [[0, 474042], [4, 474147], [9, 474267], [16, 474607], [25, 474947], [29, 475547], [34, 475787], [37, 475987], [42, 476427], [47, 476667], [51, 476827], [54, 477047], [59, 477307], [64, 477467], [69, 478365], [73, 478489], [77, 478669], [83, 478969], [85, 479189], [90, 479389]]}, {"verse": 59, "start": 480290, "end": 485757, "text": "And they sent away Rebekah their sister, and her nurse, and Abraham’s servant, and his men.", "words": [[0, 480290], [4, 480435], [9, 480555], [14, 480835], [19, 481035], [27, 481655], [33, 481815], [41, 482195], [45, 482835], [49, 482995], [56, 483415], [60, 483835], [70, 484555], [79, 484835], [83, 485155], [87, 485295]]}, {"verse": 60, "start": 486207, "end": 495573, "text": "And they blessed Rebekah, and said to her, You are our sister, be the mother of thousands of millions, and let your seed possess the gate of those which hate them.", "words": [[0, 486207], [4, 486357], [9, 486457], [17, 486917], [26, 487377], [30, 487957], [35, 488197], [38, 488377], [43, 488877], [47, 489157], [51, 489477], [55, 489697], [63, 490297], [66, 490397], [70, 490557], [77, 490757], [80, 490977], [90, 491377], [93, 491637], [103, 492651], [107, 492776], [111, 492936], [116, 493116], [121, 493396], [129, 493776], [133, 494036], [138, 494296], [141, 494476], [147, 494696], [153, 494976], [158, 495156]]}, {"verse": 61, "start": 496023, "end": 504555, "text": "¶ And Rebekah arose, and her young women, and they rode upon the camels, and followed the man: and the servant took Rebekah, and went his way.", "words": [[2, 496023], [6, 496169], [14, 496669], [21, 497029], [25, 497449], [29, 497589], [35, 497829], [42, 498529], [46, 498709], [51, 498849], [56, 499089], [61, 499389], [65, 499629], [73, 500169], [77, 500389], [86, 500769], [90, 501009], [95, 501764], [99, 501889], [103, 502009], [111, 502309], [116, 502649], [125, 502989], [129, 503609], [134, 503829], [138, 504069]]}, {"verse": 62, "start": 505005, "end": 510140, "text": "And Isaac came from the way of the well Lahai-roi; for he dwelt in the south country.", "words": [[0, 505005], [4, 505141], [10, 505461], [15, 505841], [20, 506061], [24, 506221], [28, 506441], [31, 506581], [35, 506701], [40, 507353], [51, 508261], [55, 508365], [58, 508505], [64, 508905], [67, 509065], [71, 509165], [77, 509405]]}, {"verse": 63, "start": 510590, "end": 519270, "text": "And Isaac went out to meditate in the field at the eventide: and he lifted up his eyes, and saw, and, behold, the camels were coming.", "words": [[0, 510590], [4, 510711], [10, 511031], [15, 511311], [19, 511491], [22, 511671], [31, 512111], [34, 512411], [38, 512531], [44, 512871], [47, 513051], [51, 513171], [61, 514372], [65, 514503], [68, 514603], [75, 514923], [78, 515143], [82, 515323], [88, 516083], [92, 516363], [97, 517183], [102, 517283], [110, 518103], [114, 518203], [121, 518623], [126, 518783]]}, {"verse": 64, "start": 519720, "end": 524699, "text": "And Rebekah lifted up her eyes, and when she saw Isaac, she lighted off the camel.", "words": [[0, 519720], [4, 519898], [12, 520118], [19, 520558], [22, 520798], [26, 520958], [32, 521358], [36, 521878], [41, 522038], [45, 522238], [49, 522538], [56, 523298], [60, 523398], [68, 523798], [72, 523958], [76, 524138]]}, {"verse": 65, "start": 525149, "end": 535607, "text": "For she had said to the servant, What man is this that walks in the field to meet us? And the servant had said, It is my master: therefore she took a veil, and covered herself.", "words": [[0, 525216], [4, 525286], [8, 525506], [12, 525686], [17, 525926], [20, 526126], [24, 526246], [33, 527018], [38, 527233], [42, 527493], [45, 527713], [50, 527873], [55, 528033], [61, 528293], [64, 528513], [68, 528593], [74, 528873], [77, 529053], [82, 529253], [86, 530094], [90, 530240], [94, 530340], [102, 530600], [106, 530860], [112, 531644], [115, 531820], [118, 531940], [121, 532140], [129, 533127], [139, 533405], [143, 533685], [148, 533865], [150, 533985], [156, 534285], [160, 534645], [168, 534965]]}, {"verse": 66, "start": 536057, "end": 538718, "text": "And the servant told Isaac all things that he had done.", "words": [[0, 536057], [4, 536184], [8, 536284], [16, 536544], [21, 536804], [27, 537184], [31, 537484], [38, 537784], [43, 538004], [46, 538164], [50, 538284]]}, {"verse": 67, "start": 539168, "end": 548820, "text": "And Isaac brought her into his mother Sarah’s tent, and took Rebekah, and she became his wife; and he loved her: and Isaac was comforted after his mother’s death.", "words": [[0, 539168], [4, 539312], [10, 539632], [18, 539992], [22, 540172], [27, 540392], [31, 540652], [38, 540912], [46, 541432], [52, 541692], [56, 542312], [61, 542592], [70, 542872], [74, 543592], [78, 543772], [85, 544092], [89, 544312], [95, 545168], [99, 545333], [102, 545453], [108, 545713], [113, 546386], [117, 546524], [123, 546804], [127, 547064], [137, 547604], [143, 547824], [147, 548044], [156, 548424]]}]}